# Utterances both voice assistants must route to the same intent on the fast path
# (no LLM). Format, as in the Android skill-testkit:
#   lang | utterance | intent
# "-" as intent means "must not match a local command". Slots are left out on
# purpose: slot names differ per client. Intent names are the Android ones;
# linux-aliases.txt maps them to the Linux client's names.
#
# Conversation-only phrases ("abbiamo finito") are left out: the
# Linux client matches them only while a conversation holds the floor.
#
# Canonical copy: pawnai (parakeet) contracts/utterances/. Copy into the client
# repos with scripts/sync-contracts.sh; never edit the copies.

it | che ore sono | clock.time
it | che giorno è oggi | clock.date
en | what time is it | clock.time
it | metti un timer di cinque minuti | timer.set
en | set a timer for five minutes | timer.set
it | parliamo | pawn.start
en | let's talk | pawn.start
it | sblocca le sessioni | pawn.unlock
it | blocca le sessioni | pawn.lock
en | lock the sessions | pawn.lock
it | continua qui | pawn.resume
it | riprendi la conversazione | pawn.resume
en | continue here | pawn.resume
it | sblocca col telefono | pawn.unlock_phone
en | unlock with the phone | pawn.unlock_phone
